        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(“FDA”), we are looking to communicate to consumers who have elected to use these medications what we believe are the complementary benefits of using our products to support achieving or maintaining their weight management goals.",
        "start_character": 12549,
        "end_character": 12778
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001702744-25-000046",
